  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UPLIFT DC is a project that supports the peaceful reintegration of Moro Islamic Liberation Front (MILF) decommissioned combatants (DCs) and their families into civilian life. The project aims to strengthen information and case management systems, improve access to government services, and create sustainable livelihood opportunities for former combatants and vulnerable groups, including women.The project will establish a Management Information System (MIS) to help government agencies and peace</narrative>
